OL,3,GNEWSAHospital car park to gain
OL,4,Aadditional 150 spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn additional 150 parking spaces at a
OL,7,FWolverhampton hospital will make it
OL,8,F"easier and safer" for staff and
OL,9,Fvisitors to access the site, a trust
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FThe changes at New Cross Hospital will
OL,13,Fbegin with 10 extra parking spaces for
OL,14,Fstaff and nine for disabled visitors,
OL,15,Fwith improved access to the West
OL,16,FEntrance and designated areas for
OL,17,Fdelivery drivers.
OL,19,FThe trust has previously said increased
OL,20,Fparking charges that came into effect
OL,21,Flast July would fund car parking
OL,22,Fimprovements.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
